<title>BELGIUM: TABLE -BELGIAN JULY CAR REGISTRATIONS DOWN 2.4 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE -BELGIAN JULY CAR REGISTRATIONS DOWN 2.4 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian new car registrations</p>
<p>were down 2.4 percent in July from July 1996, figures from</p>
<p>Belgian Car Federation FEBIAC showed.</p>
<p>Registrations fell 4.1 percent in the year to July compared</p>
<p>with the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>    BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS July 97	 July 96</p>
<p>    Month			   31,981	  32,781</p>
<p>    Cumulative Jan-Jul	  265,234	 276,535</p>
<p>July registrations by manufacturer and market share for</p>
<p>those above three percent versus 1996 period.</p>
<p> VW	6,367  (19.9 pct) vs   6,031  (18.4 pct)</p>
<p> Peugeot 4,970  (15.5 pct) vs   5,073  (15.5 pct)</p>
<p> GM	  3,523  (11.0 pct) vs   3,053  ( 9.3 pct)</p>
<p> Ford Motor 3,284  (10.3 pct) vs   3,735  (11.4 pct)</p>
<p> Renault 3,113  ( 9.7 pct) vs   3,564  (10.9 pct)</p>
<p> BMW     1,788  ( 5.6 pct) vs   1,822  ( 5.6 pct)</p>
<p> Mercedes 1,354  ( 4.2 pct) vs   1,162  ( 3.5 pct)</p>
<p> Fiat    1,300  ( 4.1 pct) vs   1,663  ( 5.1 pct)</p>
<p> Toyota  1,185  ( 3.7 pct) vs   1,454  ( 4.4 pct)</p>
<p> Nissan    978  ( 3.1 pct) vs     752  ( 2.3 pct)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
